- JSON format: `docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md`. Each number needs a checkable source; `verified: true` only after checking.
- Python with type hints, deterministic and re-runnable, stdlib first.
- `demo_mission.json` is generated by `science/generate_demo_mission.py`, never edited by hand.
